<title>CROATIA: Croatia March output up 3.9 pct m/m, 5.5 y/y.</title>
<headline>Croatia March output up 3.9 pct m/m, 5.5 y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details. (Previous figures in brackets.)</p>
<p> CROATIA INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT     MARCH     FEBRUARY   MARCH 96</p>
<p> Monthly change pct		+3.9     +1.1(+1.8)    +1.0</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	     +5.5     +2.5(+2.0)    -6.6</p>
<p> Index (base 1995)		105.9    101.9(101.4)  100.4</p>
</text>
